        "text": "Fang Yuan later activates it in the dream cavern and judges it outstanding among rank two Gu, silent, and able to wreck walls without touching the cavern’s defenses. From the rank two recipe he can deduce rank one through rank five versions, and he notes he can push further toward sneak attack Immortal Gu recipes with the light of wisdom.",
        "chapters": [
